        "content": "## Web Scraping Pipeline (Crawl4AI + Qdrant)\n\nDefines target competitor URLs and metadata, extracts clean Fit Markdown from dynamic web pages via Crawl4AI, splits the content into chunks (1000/200), generates local embeddings with Ollama (nomic-embed-text), and indexes the vectors into Qdrant.",
